flowchart TB
  subgraph native ["Native agent harnesses remain in control"]
    Claude["Claude Code<br/>commands · hooks · subagents"]
    Codex["Codex<br/>/goal · memory · skills · plugins"]
    Cursor["Cursor<br/>rules · sessions · terminal"]
    Others["Copilot · Antigravity · Hermes<br/>AGENTS.md · terminal"]
  end

  subgraph adapters ["Thin provider adapters"]
    ClaudeAdapter["Claude command wrappers"]
    CodexAdapter["AGENTS.md + optional Codex skill"]
    CursorAdapter["AGENTS.md + Cursor project rule"]
    UniversalAdapter["AGENTS.md + direct CLI"]
  end

  Core["Agent Master CLI<br/>init · start · status · checkpoint · validate · handoff · complete"]

  subgraph project ["Repository-local source of truth"]
    Stable["Committed context<br/>project.json · docs · adapters"]
    Runtime["Portable runtime state<br/>runs · events · evidence · locks"]
  end

  Claude --> ClaudeAdapter
  Codex --> CodexAdapter
  Cursor --> CursorAdapter
  Others --> UniversalAdapter
  ClaudeAdapter --> Core
  CodexAdapter --> Core
  CursorAdapter --> Core
  UniversalAdapter --> Core
  Core --> Stable
  Core --> Runtime
  Runtime -->|"handoff"| native

